<!-- Tag list for $hgsd.list's "Sort by" select (sort-select="yes"). Members carry pure data plus a caption (a lingo transclusion — the core PageControls convention): `hgsd-sort-filter` is a COMPLETE sort expression in standard suffix-run form — `[enlist<titles>] <sort-runs>` — any operator combination is valid, so multi-field sorts are just more runs (+[nsort[gsd_status]] +[sort[title]]); the member's `caption` field (a lingo transclusion — the core PageControls convention) is the display name for BOTH this Settings drag list and the strip; `hgsd-sort-key` remains only as the lingo-fallback id for caption-less third-party members; `hgsd-sort-category` groups options under an <optgroup> (label via SortBy/Category/<value>, fallback to the value; absent = bare option); optional `hgsd-types` restricts offering to lists whose items carry one of those type-tag-list short names. The first member in this list field is also the strip's effective default display — keep modified-desc first to match $hgsd.list's sort-default. Ordering: this list field, then alphabetical. -->